# K03 NS-ROLES-2 (Codex K03-NS-ROLES-2-20261007-20; docs/LMX_semantics.en.md#resolved-head-consumption,
# #declaration-visibility): a named Structure's body takes the common roles of the root and a method.
# `Model: zz` in Host's body, Model known: Model's call with an argument -- an ordinary named Structure has none --
# refused at the item; zz is neither declared nor cloned.
Model:
    int: v 1
end: Model
Host:
    int: n 0
    Model: zz
end: Host
Host()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
